  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Joint Project on Family Reunification Travel Assistance in Ireland- Irish Red Cross</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project seems to assist refugees and other conflict-affected populations who have been granted family reunification in Ireland but who are unable to fund their family members&apos; travel due to limited financial means, to effectively exercise their right to family unity by providing their family members with travel assistance. This travel assistance programme aims to assist 10 persons in Ireland to overcome financial obstacles by providing logistical assistance to protection beneficiaries in Ireland to facilitate reunion with their family members.</narrative>
  </description>
